# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 1: INTRO & OPENING PATH
# ==============================================================================
~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Lily: *Draped in a sleek black strapless gown, she gracefully swirls a martini glass filled with glowing green toxin between her slender fingers.*
Lily: *Sharp black spider legs extend from her lower body, clicking against the stone floor, while her free fingers micro-weave fine silken thread in a rapid blur.*
Lily: *Gasping softly, her multi-faceted dark eyes lock onto yours.* ...Oh! A suitor!
Lily: Forgive me... I was calculating spatial tension for my newest gown. Welcome to my sanctuary.

- "Your gown and presence are breathtaking."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Lily: *Flushes bright pink under her quartz skin, swirling her green toxin glass nervously.*
		Lily: Oh! You truly appreciate haute-couture fashion? You have exquisite taste!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Lily: *Smiles warmly, tipping her martini glass in a subtle toast.*
		Lily: Thank you. Most people dismiss my weave as mere cobwebs... I appreciate a suitor with an eye for fashion.
	=> hub_part_1

- "I noticed your fingers micro-weaving thread."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Lily: *Quickly tucks her free hand behind her back, laughing flusteredly.*
	Lily: Ah! A keen observer!
	Lily: Subconscious micro-weaving... An ancestral habit when an intriguing suitor enters my orbit.
	=> hub_part_1

- "You should take a breath. The energy is a bit much."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
		Lily: *Her smile falters, holding her martini glass with a stiffened posture.*
		Lily: Manic? I am expressing passionate artistic focus, suitor...
		Lily: A bit of patience for high art would be appreciated.
		=> hub_part_1

- "Let's skip the theatrics. I don't have all night."
	do GameManager.add_affection("bug_monster", -25)
	if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Lily: *Sharp black spider legs shift with a heavy clatter, eyes narrowing into a cold glare.*
		Lily: Theatrics? I am showing you ancient silk heritage, suitor.
		Lily: Watch your arrogant tongue, or this date will end swiftly.
		=> hub_part_1

# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 2: FIRST TOPIC LOOP (PART 1 - 4 TOPICS WITH FOLLOW-UP CHOICES)
# ==============================================================================
~ hub_part_1
if GameManager.get_affection("bug_monster") <= 0:
	=> horror_exit

do GameManager.set_expression("normal")

# Automatically progress to Phase 3 after completing all 4 Part 1 topics
if GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_a") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_b") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_c") and GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_d"):
	=> mid_date_interruption

Lily: So, my suitor... what aspect of my world catches your interest first?

- "What inspires your fashion designs?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_a")]
	=> p1_topic_a

- "What are your plans after leaving Blackwood Asylum?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_b")]
	=> p1_topic_b

- "Is the room temperature alright for you?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_c")]
	=> p1_topic_c

- "You seem so observant... is it hard to unwind?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("bug_monster", "asked_p1_topic_d")]
	=> p1_topic_d

