	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Lily: *Sets her martini glass down with a cold clink.*
	Lily: You lack an eye for true haute-couture. The date is over.
	Lily: *Turns away without a second glance.*
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Lily: *Gasps as her eyes catch the clock, setting her martini glass on the table.*
	Lily: Oh! Look at the time! My creative sprint is peaking!
	Lily: *Gives a polite bow.* Thank you for sitting with me tonight. Goodbye for now!

do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END

~ horror_exit
do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
Lily: *Her martini glass shatters in her grip with a violent crack! Glowing green toxin splashes across the table as sharp black spider legs rise menacingly!*
Lily: *Fangs bare fully as razor-sharp silken strands shoot from her palms, sealing the exit!*
Lily: YOU DARE MOCK MY ANCESTRAL CRAFT?! YOU ARE NOT A SUITOR, YOU ARE HUMAN MEAT! YOU WILL MAKE A FINE LIVING SCULPTURE FOR MY COLLECTION!
Lily: *She lunges forward with a terrifying predatory hiss!*
[SYSTEM]: *ALARM SIRENS BLARE* "CODE RED! DETECTIVE GET OUT NOW!"
[SYSTEM]: Guards drag you backward out of the cell as an iron portcullis gate slams down with a heavy crash.
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
